    "chunk_text": ", o\u00f0 hie gl\u00e6dmode gegan h\u00e6fdon to \u00f0am wealgate. Wiggend s\u00e6ton, weras w\u00e6ccende wearde heoldon in \u00f0am f\u00e6stenne, swa \u00f0am folce \u00e6r geomormodum W\u00e6s \u00f0a eft cumen leof to leodum, ond \u00f0a lungre het gleawhydig wif gumena sumne of \u00f0\u00e6re ginnan Eow ys metod bli\u00f0e, cyninga wuldor; \u00fe\u00e6t gecy\u00f0ed wear\u00f0 geond woruld wide, \u00fe\u00e6t eow ys wuldorbl\u00e6d \u00dea wurdon bli\u00f0e burhsittende, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi gehyrdon hu seo halige spr\u00e6c ofer heanne weall. Here w\u00e6s on lustum. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6stengeates folc onette, weras wif somod, wornum ond heapum, \u00f0reatum ond \u00f0rymmum \u00c6ghwylcum wear\u00f0 men on \u00f0\u00e6re medobyrig mod areted, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hie ongeaton \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Iudith cumen \u00dea seo gleawe het, golde gefr\u00e6tewod, hyre \u00f0inenne \u00feancolmode \u00fe\u00e6s herew\u00e6\u00f0an heafod onwri\u00f0an ond Spr\u00e6c \u00f0a seo \u00e6\u00f0ele to eallum \u00feam folce: Her ge magon sweotole sigerofe h\u00e6le\u00f0, leoda r\u00e6swan, on Nu ic gumena gehw\u00e6ne \u00feyssa burgleoda biddan wylle, randwiggendra, \u00fe\u00e6t ge recene eow fysan to Sy\u00f0\u00f0an frym\u00f0a god, arf\u00e6st cyning, eastan sende leohtne leoman, bera\u00f0 linde for\u00f0, bord for breostum Fynd syndon eowere gedemed to dea\u00f0e, ond ge dom agon, tir \u00e6t tohtan, swa eow getacnod hafa\u00f0 \u00dea wear\u00f0 snel",
